{"track":"r","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"제곱","desc":"<p>수 <code>x</code>의 제곱을 돌려주는 <code>square(x)</code>를 만드세요. R의 거듭제곱 연산자는 <code>^</code> 예요.</p>","solution":"square <- function(x) {\n  x^2\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>x^2</code> 는 x의 제곱이에요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"square(4)","expected":16,"visible":true},{"call":"square(-3)","expected":9,"visible":true},{"call":"square(0)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"square(1.5)","expected":2.25,"visible":false},{"call":"square(10)","expected":100,"visible":false}],"starter":"square <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-301"}